# Forest-installed dependency trees. NEVER format these: they are vendored third-party code
# downloaded at a known integrity hash, and reformatting them silently makes the working tree
# diverge from what `forest install` produced -- including the generated pointer files. If a
# vendored file looks wrong, the fix is `forest install -f`, not a formatter.
Packages/

# Superseded game banks, kept for provenance. Reformatting them would destroy the record of
# what was actually banked.
game/archive/
